  "document": "The Pleasure Garden (1925 film)\nThe Pleasure Garden is a 1925 British- German silent film directed by Alfred Hitchcock in his directorial debut. Based on a novel by Oliver Sandys, the film is about two chorus girls at the Pleasure Garden Theatre in London and their troubled relationships."
